{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.72},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":30.16},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.36,"end":43.68}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.72,"text":"觀察到的中獎比例會隨樣本改變。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.36,"end":6.08,"text":"固定種子能讓模擬序列重現，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.16,"end":7.6,"text":"方便公平比較。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.32,"end":10.56,"text":"公平遊戲也可能連續落敗；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.2,"end":14.72,"text":"獨立的下一次遊戲不會補償前面的損失。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.68,"end":18.56,"text":"用種子 7 和 8 各跑 20 次，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.88,"end":20.32,"text":"再改成 500 次。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.04,"end":22.16,"text":"比較中獎比例，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.32,"end":25.28,"text":"不要要求任何樣本恰好等於 p。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.08,"end":27.2,"text":"連輸五次後，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.6,"end":30.16,"text":"下一次獨立中獎會更容易嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":31.36,"end":32.64,"text":"連輸五次後，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.04,"end":35.68,"text":"下一次獨立中獎會更容易嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.88,"end":40.4,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":41.12,"end":43.68,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}